# CODEOWNERS.example → copy to `.github/CODEOWNERS` (GitHub) and adapt owners.
# These files DEFINE the quality gates. An agent that cannot suppress an error may try to weaken a gate instead,
# so changes here need a human owner's review. This only works if branch protection has
# "Require review from Code Owners" enabled (a repository setting a human must switch on; not verified here).

/eslint.config.js            @your-org/platform
/eslint.no-suppress.js       @your-org/platform
/eslint.boundaries.js        @your-org/platform
/eslint.code-rules.js        @your-org/platform
/eslint.ai-docs.js           @your-org/platform
/tsconfig*.json              @your-org/platform
/package.json                @your-org/platform
/pnpm-lock.yaml              @your-org/platform
/scripts/check-*.mjs         @your-org/platform
/shadcn-primitives.lock.json @your-org/platform
/.claude/                    @your-org/platform
/.mcp.json                   @your-org/platform
/.github/                    @your-org/platform
/AGENTS.md                   @your-org/platform
/docs/03-standards/          @your-org/platform
